+/**
+ * Daily Grind document signing.
+ *
+ * Signs and verifies order receipts and gift vouchers with the Web Cryptography
+ * API. Prefers the post-quantum ML-DSA-65 suite (NIST FIPS 204) and falls back
+ * to classical Ed25519, then ECDSA P-256, on browsers that lack it.
