+
+COLD BREW
+- Coarse-ground single-origin Colombian beans steeped in cold filtered water for 18 hours, then double filtered for maximum smoothness.
+- Naturally low acidity, chocolatey and smooth, never bitter. Served over ice, black by default; any milk or syrup can be added.
+- Sizes: 16 oz ($4.75), 20 oz ($5.50). Roughly 200 mg caffeine in a 16 oz; about 5 calories black.
