+    <p><em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}. The DevTools Times is a demo site (see the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/imprint`}>Imprint</a>). This page nevertheless describes exactly what the site does with data, because that is how it is built.</em></p>
